# oracle: min_style fire with integrator eulerexplicit on a perturbed lj crystal (src/min_fire.cpp: the integrator, abcfire and vdfmax of min_modify; thermo dt shows the timestep fire grows and shrinks)
# oracle-inputs: w47qm_lj.data
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 8.1e-13, atoms 7.1e-14.
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
read_data       w47qm_lj.data
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor        0.3 bin
min_style       fire
timestep        0.03
min_modify      dmax 0.02 integrator eulerexplicit
thermo_style    custom step pe fnorm fmax press dt
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          2
minimize        0 0 60 1000
